------------------------------ MODULE DeviceMeshFacts ------------------------------
EXTENDS Naturals, Sequences, FiniteSets, TLC

\* INFERRED, NOT OBSERVED: CollectiveProducers and CollectiveStream
\* come from a positional zip of NCCL Flight Recorder entries,
\* ordered by record_id, to Kineto kernels, ordered by start time.
\* There is no join key between the two sources; equal counts and
\* equal order are the whole argument. Ticket 09 replaces this with
\* a joined key. Do not build an invariant on either operator.

