\* BEGIN collective payload facts
\* OBSERVED, per tensor, and PLURAL: a collective over several
\* tensors has one shape and one dtype name per tensor, so the
\* size and dtype sequences run in parallel. An EMPTY shape is a
\* 0-dim tensor of one element -- a reduced scalar -- and is
\* accepted; a zero or negative dimension is not.
\* CollectivePayloadComm is process_group.canonical_id, the same
\* key as CollectiveComm and never runtime_pg_id, which is
\* per-rank local numbering: PayloadCommKeyIsCommunicatorIdentity
\* refutes a runtime-id keying by requiring works that share a
\* payload key to share a member set.
\* Element counts are DERIVED by the exporter. The checkers
